====== Sinovoip Banana Pi M2+ ======

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://www.sinovoip.com.cn/ecpzs.asp?dlb_id=142|here for BananaPi]].

For further Allwinner-based boards, please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]


